\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father, lead me day by day
\par Ever in Thine own sweet way;
\par Teach me to be pure and true,
\par Show me what I ought to do.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When in danger, make me brave;
\par Make me know that Thou canst save;
\par Keep me safe by Thy dear side;
\par Let me in Thy love abide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When I'm tempted to do wrong,
\par Make me steadfast, wise and strong;
\par And when all alone I stand,
\par Shield me with Thy mighty hand.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. When my heart is full of glee,
\par Help me to remember Thee,
\par Happy most of all to know
\par That my Father loves me so.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. When my work seems hard and dry,
\par May I press on cheerily;
\par Help me patiently to bear
\par Pain and hardship, toil and care.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. May I see the good and bright
\par When they pass before my sight;
\par May I hear the heavenly voice
\par When the pure and wise rejoice.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

